Package: gRm
Title: Parallel R Implementation of Non-GUI DIGRAM
Version: 0.00
Authors@R: c(
    person("DIGRAM", "Reimplementation", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
  )
Author: DIGRAM Reimplementation
Maintainer: DIGRAM Reimplementation <noreply@example.com>
Description: Experimental native R implementation of selected non-GUI DIGRAM
    GLLRM computations. The package exposes source-faithful numeric model,
    screening, and diagnostic results through a compact statistical modeling
    API centered on summary(). Historical DIGRAM output parsing and validation
    live in repository-level tooling outside the installed package.
